sequenceDiagram
    %% SD7 - Deliver the groceries
    %% Stories: 13, 33, 34, 35, 36, 47, 48, 49, 50, 51
    %% Description: A customer has groceries delivered at a chosen time, by express or by subscription. An employee confirms the delivery time and informs the customer about problems.
    actor CP as Customer (person)
    actor EM as Employee
    participant CU as Customer
    participant DL as Delivery
    participant OD as Order

    %% covers 13
    CP->>CU: subscribe to the delivery service
    %% covers 33
    CP->>CU: have groceries delivered
    %% covers 34, 35, 36
    CP->>CU: choose date and time slot or express delivery
    CU->>DL: delivery
    DL->>OD: order to deliver
    %% covers 47
    EM->>DL: confirm delivery time
    %% covers 48, 49
    EM->>DL: report unavailable products or a delay
    %% covers 50, 51
    EM->>DL: cancel and offer a new delivery time
    DL->>CU: notify of changes
